Description: Price Oracle E2E Test
Network: ./price-oracle.toml
Creds: config

# All validators should be running
alice: is up within 30 seconds
bob: is up within 30 seconds
charlie: is up within 30 seconds
dave: is up within 30 seconds

# Chain should be producing blocks
alice: reports block height is at least 5 within 60 seconds

# Check price oracle service started (via log)
alice: log line contains "Price oracle service started" within 30 seconds

# Check that price was fetched from an API
alice: log line contains "Fetched DOT/USD price" within 30 seconds

# After several blocks, the oracle inherent should have updated the price
alice: reports block height is at least 15 within 120 seconds
